00:37:22.830 --> 00:37:27.850
So, and once they taped it on, they were really like, guys, please don't take your note card
所以，一旦他们把卡贴好，他们就会非常严肃地说，伙计们，请千万别把记事卡

969
00:37:27.850 --> 00:37:28.570
off your forehead.
从额头上撕下来。

970
00:37:28.850 --> 00:37:32.210
So imagine being like, oh, we have a 15-minute break.
所以想象一下，比如我们有15分钟的休息时间。

971
00:37:32.410 --> 00:37:34.890
I'm going to get some pretzels and a cheese stick.
我想去拿点椒盐卷饼和奶酪棒吃。

972
00:37:35.010 --> 00:37:39.610
But I'm eating the cheese stick and pretzels while wearing, you know, a note card in my head
但我一边吃着奶酪棒和椒盐卷饼，一边还得在额头上贴着

973
00:37:39.610 --> 00:37:40.350
that said Jamaica.
写有“牙买加”字样的记事卡。

974
00:37:40.710 --> 00:37:41.530
That's how we walked around.
我们就是那样走来走去的。

975
00:37:41.650 --> 00:37:43.010
Like, we went to the bathroom.
比如，我们去洗手间的时候也是这样。

976
00:37:43.210 --> 00:37:43.370
Yeah.
没错。

977
00:37:44.110 --> 00:37:44.810
Oh, my Lord.
天哪。

978
00:37:44.950 --> 00:37:48.130
A lot of people asked about the note cards.
很多人问起那些记事卡的事。

979
00:37:48.130 --> 00:37:52.150
It's like, was there, did we have any say in what our note card said?
比如，我们对卡片上写的内容有发言权吗？

980
00:37:52.170 --> 00:37:52.610
No.
没有。

981
00:37:52.810 --> 00:37:52.970
No.
没有。

982
00:37:53.090 --> 00:37:54.150
It was all scripted.
全是写好的剧本。

983
00:37:54.270 --> 00:37:55.130
It wasn't random.
不是随机的。

984
00:37:55.450 --> 00:38:01.210
A lot of people asked questions about how much improvisation happened in the scenes with
很多人问到在那些贴着记事卡的场景里，有多少即兴发挥的成分。

985
00:38:01.210 --> 00:38:01.790
the note cards.
那些全都是剧本写好的。

986
00:38:01.930 --> 00:38:03.110
All that was scripted.
全是剧本。

987
00:38:03.110 --> 00:38:03.770
All scripted.
全是剧本。

988
00:38:03.930 --> 00:38:05.810
Dwight saying, oh, man, am I a woman?
德怀特说，天哪，我是个女人吗？

989
00:38:05.810 --> 00:38:06.750
That was scripted.
那是剧本写好的。

990
00:38:07.310 --> 00:38:14.210
There was even a deleted scene in there where Jim pranks Dwight after Dwight figures out
甚至还有一个被删减的片段，德怀特猜出

